2. WHAT THIS REPOSITORY DOES ALLOW

   This repository contains a catalogue: a set of small JSON records describing
   publicly available picture-generating services, the schema those records
   follow, and a checking tool.

   You may read them, and you may use them to understand the format or to write a
   record of your own, including for a proposal to this repository or for your own
   use inside SIXFINGERS.

   You may not present the catalogue, or a copy of it, as part of any other
   product, nor use it to build a service that competes with or imitates
   SIXFINGERS.


3. CONTRIBUTIONS

   If you propose a source record and it is accepted, you keep the credit for it
   and you grant Tristan Ulrich a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free,
   irrevocable, sublicensable right to use, ship, modify and distribute that
   record as part of SIXFINGERS.

   You confirm that the record is yours to give, that it describes a service you
   are permitted to describe, and that shipping it breaks nobody's rules.

   Contributing gives you no rights over SIXFINGERS itself.


4. NO WARRANTY

   Everything here is provided as it is, with no warranty of any kind. The
